flowchart TD
    DOCS[检索到的 context_docs] --> GROUP[按 topic/首行分组]
    GROUP --> MULTI{同组 ≥2 条?}
    MULTI -->|否| SKIP[跳过]
    MULTI -->|是| DIFF{内容不同?}
    DIFF -->|否| SKIP
    DIFF -->|是| PRI[_meta_priority<br/>policy>faq, 新日期优先]
    PRI --> OUT[ConflictItem + resolution_hint]
    OUT --> FMT[format_conflicts 注入 Prompt]
